          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Only the $X$ column matters here. $n=5$ and<br/>$$\\bar x=\\frac{5+6+7+4+9}{5}=\\frac{31}{5}=6.2.$$<br/>$$S_{xx}=\\sum(x_i-\\bar x)^2=(-1.2)^2+(-0.2)^2+(0.8)^2+(-2.2)^2+(2.8)^2=1.44+0.04+0.64+4.84+7.84=14.8.$$<br/>Now plug in with $\\hat\\sigma^2=1.56^2=2.4336$:<br/>$$\\frac{1}{n}+\\frac{\\bar x^2}{S_{xx}}=0.2+\\frac{38.44}{14.8}=0.2+2.5973=2.7973.$$<br/>$$se(\\hat\\beta_0)=\\sqrt{2.4336\\times 2.7973}=\\sqrt{6.808}=2.609\\approx 2.6.$$</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Ở đây chỉ cần cột $X$. $n=5$ và<br/>$$\\bar x=\\frac{5+6+7+4+9}{5}=\\frac{31}{5}=6{,}2.$$<br/>$$S_{xx}=\\sum(x_i-\\bar x)^2=(-1{,}2)^2+(-0{,}2)^2+(0{,}8)^2+(-2{,}2)^2+(2{,}8)^2=1{,}44+0{,}04+0{,}64+4{,}84+7{,}84=14{,}8.$$<br/>Thay vào với $\\hat\\sigma^2=1{,}56^2=2{,}4336$:<br/>$$\\frac{1}{n}+\\frac{\\bar x^2}{S_{xx}}=0{,}2+\\frac{38{,}44}{14{,}8}=0{,}2+2{,}5973=2{,}7973.$$<br/>$$se(\\hat\\beta_0)=\\sqrt{2{,}4336\\times 2{,}7973}=\\sqrt{6{,}808}=2{,}609\\approx 2{,}6.$$</p></div>"
